// (desk.manufactures, desk.food, desk.care, desk.shelter, desk.mach, provider, workers.wa, workers.wb).
// The free step (FREE-SPEC §6.1): p' = p*e^(kx) + (c*p_ref)*expm1(kx), 0 where that is not
